    \'[.//div[@data-field="StockOnSoPCS"][normalize-space(.) = "0"]]\'
    \')[1]//input[@aria-label="Select row"]\'
).click(force=True)','passed','2026-09-01 10:58:04','2026-09-10 10:56:03','Pagination Text: 1–1000 of 4464
